From 1949 to 1979, passenger plates in New Hampshire featured a two-letter code indicating the county in which the vehicle was registered, as follows:<ref>{{cite web |last=Reback |first=Brian P. |title= New Hampshire - county codes |url=http://www.bprlicenseplates.com/New%20Hampshire%20-%20county%20codes.htm |publisher=bprlicenseplates.com |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150402103651/http://www.bprlicenseplates.com/New%20Hampshire%20-%20county%20codes.htm |archive-date=April 2, 2015 |access-date= May 6, 2013}}</ref>

